{"seq":1,"slug":"omnibus-prior-price-rule","title":"Omnibus 原价标示（前30天最低价）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/promo-price-indication-law/omnibus-prior-price-rule","wordCount":2130,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"omnibus-原价标示-前30天最低价\">Omnibus 原价标示（前30天最低价）</h1><p>「原价 ¥299，现价 ¥149」这行字里，<strong>「原价」不是你的历史售价，而是一个法律定义的计算结果</strong>。欧盟 2019 年的《综合指令》（Omnibus Directive, Directive (EU) 2019/2161）在《价格标示指令》里插入了 Article 6a，把这件事彻底锁死：任何降价公告都必须标出经营者在降价前一段确定时间内实际应用的前价，而<strong>这个前价是指降价前不少于 30 天期间内所应用的最低价格</strong>（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32019L2161\">Directive (EU) 2019/2161, Article 2</a>）。注意条文写的是「所应用的最低价格」（the lowest price applied），不是你希望展示的那个价——促销价、会员价、渠道差异价只要实际应用过，都进入这个集合。</p>\n<p>这条规则 2022 年 5 月 28 日起在成员国适用；德国把它几乎逐字搬进了《价格标示条例》§11，只补了两类例外。它带来的工程后果是：<strong>你必须存价格变更流水，而不是只存一个「原价」字段</strong>。促销系统的第一性数据结构不是 <code>product.original_price</code>，而是一张带生效时间区间的价格历史表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把三个容易混淆的概念分开。<strong>成交价</strong>（selling price）是消费者当下要付的钱；<strong>前价</strong>（prior price）是 Article 6a 定义的、用于展示的参照价；<strong>参考价</strong>（reference price）是更宽泛的概念，包含厂商建议零售价、竞品价等任何被用来做比较的价。大多数误判来自把「我们上次卖多少」当成前价——法律意义上的前价是<strong>窗口内的最低成交价</strong>，哪怕窗口内只有一天降到过那个数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"窗口怎么切\">窗口怎么切</h3><p>「降价前至少 30 天」在实现上有两种读法：以公告日为终点向前取 30 个自然日，或按经营者的价格日历取 30 个完整定价周期。条文说「not shorter than 30 days」，给了下界不给上界，成员国可以要求更长。工程上稳妥的做法是<strong>以公告时刻为终点、向前取固定 30 个自然日</strong>，并对成员国加长的情形把窗口长度做成按市场配置的参数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[价格变更流水&lt;br/&gt;price_change_log] --&gt; B[按 market + offer 分组]&#10;  B --&gt; C{窗口内是否有成交?}&#10;  C --&gt;|有| D[取窗口内最低成交价 = 前价]&#10;  C --&gt;|无| E[取上一次公布价&lt;br/&gt;或按市场规则降级]&#10;  D --&gt; F[公告日 T 为窗口右端点]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{降价是逐步递增?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[取首次降价前的无折扣价]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[前价直接用于展示]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[展示: 划线前价 + 现价]\">graph TD\n  A[价格变更流水&lt;br/&gt;price_change_log] --&gt; B[按 market + offer 分组]\n  B --&gt; C{窗口内是否有成交?}\n  C --&gt;|有| D[取窗口内最低成交价 = 前价]\n  C --&gt;|无| E[取上一次公布价&lt;br/&gt;或按市场规则降级]\n  D --&gt; F[公告日 T 为窗口右端点]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{降价是逐步递增?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[取首次降价前的无折扣价]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[前价直接用于展示]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[展示: 划线前价 + 现价]</pre><h3 id=\"什么算-应用过的价格\">什么算「应用过的价格」</h3><p>这决定了流水该记什么。以下几种都必须进入集合：站内标准售价；活动价与秒杀价；针对全体消费者的优惠券后价（如果结算时直接体现）；会员价与订阅价中无需额外条件的部分。而<strong>个体化降价</strong>（定向优惠券、单一用户议价）在德国被明确排除在适用之外（<a href=\"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/pangv_2022/__11.html\">PAngV §11 Abs. 4</a>），是否进入前价集合要按市场确认。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价格类型</th>\n<th>是否进入前价集合</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>实现要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>站内标准售价</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Article 6a「所应用的价格」</td>\n<td>主流水，必须逐笔落库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全场活动价</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>实际向所有消费者应用</td>\n<td>记录活动 ID 以便追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会员价（无门槛）</td>\n<td>多数市场是</td>\n<td>实际应用过即入集</td>\n<td>需按市场标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个体化定向降价</td>\n<td>德国明确否</td>\n<td>PAngV §11 Abs. 4 排除</td>\n<td>单独标记，不进集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>易腐商品的临期降价</td>\n<td>德国明确否</td>\n<td>PAngV §11 Abs. 4 排除</td>\n<td>需标注降价原因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>厂商建议零售价</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>非「应用过」的价格</td>\n<td>只能作参考价另标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"窗口切分的边界情况\">窗口切分的边界情况</h3><p><strong>时区</strong>是第一个陷阱。窗口右端点必须定义为公告在目标市场生效的时刻，不是你的服务器时间。一个在 UTC 23:30 发布的德国站公告，对应的当地时间已是次日；如果流水用 UTC 存而窗口用本地日切，你会稳定地算错一天，而这一天恰好可能包含窗口内最低的那个价。</p>\n<p><strong>连续促销</strong>是第二个陷阱。如果商品在过去 60 天里从未回到标准价，「30 天窗口内的最低价」就是你自己的促销价，展示出来现价与前价几乎相同。这正是规则的设计意图：它不允许你拿一个从未真正执行的标准价当参照。系统必须在发布前检出并告警。</p>\n<p><strong>退款与撤销</strong>是第三个。一笔以促销价成交但随后全额退款的订单是否算「应用过该价格」？主流解释是算——价格被应用过的事实不因交易取消而消灭。稳妥做法是流水保留全部记录，计算时用显式的 <code>includeRefunded</code> 配置区分口径并记录所选口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前价的取数与计算\">前价的取数与计算</h2><p>前价计算的输入是一段价格流水，输出是一个标量。设公告时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，窗口长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（默认 30 天），流水为有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_i, p_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示自 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 起价格被设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{prior}} = \\min\\{\\, p_i \\mid t - W \\le t_i &lt; t \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prior</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若窗口内没有任何记录从标准价开始生效（商品在窗口开始前就已处于促销态），按市场规则降级：或延长窗口直到找到一段非促销区间，或拒绝这次公告。展示规则要求前价高于现价，这一约束反过来成为计算结果的最小校验：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>current</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{prior}} &gt; P_{\\text{current}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prior</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不成立就该拦。</p>\n<p>下面给出流水 schema 与计算查询的骨架，只保留前价计算真正用得到的字段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE price_change_log (&#10;  id              BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  offer_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  market          CHAR(2)     NOT NULL,&#10;  channel         TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to    TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  price_amount    NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency        CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  price_kind      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  exclude_reason  TEXT,&#10;  source_ref      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE (offer_id, market, channel, effective_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_pcl_window&#10;  ON price_change_log (offer_id, market, effective_from DESC)&#10;  WHERE exclude_reason IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> price_change_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  offer_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  price_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  price_kind      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exclude_reason  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (offer_id, market, channel, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_pcl_window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_change_log (offer_id, market, effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exclude_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH win AS (&#10;  SELECT p.price_amount&#10;  FROM price_change_log p&#10;  WHERE p.offer_id = $1&#10;    AND p.market = $2&#10;    AND p.exclude_reason IS NULL&#10;    AND p.effective_from &gt;= $3::timestamptz - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;    AND p.effective_from &lt;  $3::timestamptz&#10;)&#10;SELECT MIN(price_amount) AS prior_price FROM win;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">price_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_change_log p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">offer_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exclude_reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(price_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>exclude_reason</code> 这一列是整套设计的枢纽：个体化降价、易腐临期降价、系统纠错回滚都往里写原因，查询用部分索引一次性排除。把「排除」做成数据而不是代码分支，才能在监管问询时回答「这一次为什么没算进去」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逐步降价的处理\">逐步降价的处理</h2><p>大促常见的做法是价格逐级下探：299 → 249 → 199 → 149。如果每一级都按 Article 6a 计算，第三级的前价会是 199，展示成「原价 199，现价 149」，消费者看不到真实的落差。条文给了应对授权：<strong>当降价是逐步递增的时候，前价可以取首次降价之前的无折扣价格</strong>（Article 6a(5)，德国 PAngV §11 Abs. 2 对应落地）。这里的「逐步递增」必须同时满足三个条件才成立：降价之间没有中断（价格未回升过）、幅度递增或持平、且每一步都是降价而非提价。系统需要在流水中识别这样的序列，把它标记成一个降价活动，并让其成员共享同一个前价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与会员价-渠道价的交互\">与会员价、渠道价的交互</h3><p>同一个 offer 在不同渠道（自建站、Amazon 德国站、TikTok Shop）的售价可能不同。Article 6a 的约束对象是<strong>作出该降价公告的经营者在其渠道上应用的价格</strong>，所以前价必须按渠道隔离计算，不能跨渠道取最小值。跨渠道取最小值会让前价更低、折扣看起来更大，但它恰恰是不实的。数据库层面用 <code>(offer_id, market, channel)</code> 做计算分组键就是这个原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Article 6a 把前价定义为降价前不少于 30 天内的最低应用价，是定义式规则，经营者没有解释空间；实现上必须存价格变更流水而非单一原价字段。</li>\n<li>窗口右端点是公告在市场本地生效的时刻，时区处理错了会稳定算错一天；窗口长度按市场可配置，30 天是下界不是定值。</li>\n<li>「什么算应用过的价格」决定流水该记什么：标准价、活动价、无门槛会员价入集，个体化降价与易腐临期降价按市场规则排除，排除原因必须落库（德国依据 <a href=\"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/pangv_2022/__11.html\">PAngV §11</a>）。</li>\n<li>逐步递增降价共享首次降价前的前价，但必须满足无中断、不回升、幅度不减三个条件。</li>\n<li>前价必须按渠道隔离计算，跨渠道取最小值会得到更低的前价与更大的折扣，属于不实展示。</li>\n<li>两种典型违法形态都能用同一条查询检出：连续促销导致前价等于现价（折扣为零的伪对比），以及先抬价后降价导致现价高于前价。前价与现价的数值关系是跨市场共有的最小校验。展示口径见 <a href=\"strikethrough-discount-rule\">划线价与折扣力度合规</a>，各市场差异见 <a href=\"country-price-marketing-rule\">各国促销价格标示矩阵</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Omnibus 原价标示（前30天最低价）","id":"omnibus-原价标示-前30天最低价"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口怎么切","id":"窗口怎么切"},{"level":3,"text":"什么算「应用过的价格」","id":"什么算-应用过的价格"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口切分的边界情况","id":"窗口切分的边界情况"},{"level":2,"text":"前价的取数与计算","id":"前价的取数与计算"},{"level":2,"text":"逐步降价的处理","id":"逐步降价的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"与会员价、渠道价的交互","id":"与会员价-渠道价的交互"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"划线价与折扣力度合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/promo-price-indication-law/strikethrough-discount-rule"}}